ion></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团龙猫发布1.6万亿参数原生多模态模型LongCat-2.5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bf31e0caa224c84d5800eadd2a6f8ef2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美团龙猫于11月2日发布LongCat-2.5，这是一款定位长程智能体任务的原生多模态模型，总参数量达1.6万亿，每token激活约480亿参数。该模型在LongCat-2.0基础上强化了原生视觉理解与智能体编程能力，目前已开放API接入与在线体验，GitHub及HuggingFace权重即将上线。技术上，模型采用多层级离散token表示视觉信号，并结合Agentic RL链路提升智能体泛化能力。针对国产算力环境，LongCat-2.5优化了超节点并行与双重分片FSDP，长序列SFT单卡吞吐量较DDP基线提升86%。推理侧引入W4A4量化方案，相比W8A8基线，Prefill与Decode吞吐分别提升43.3%和42.77%，TTFT与TPOT显著降低。在Terminal Bench v4.0等评测中，该模型表</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">特斯拉量产版Optimus人形机器人首次搭载端到端视觉大模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/64f9fdb26b2a6e877b5e080058b0050e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">特斯拉最新量产版Optimus人形机器人迎来重大技术升级，首次全面搭载与FSD同源的端到端视觉大模型。该架构摒弃了传统硬编码程序，采用由神经网络直接驱动的“视觉输入到动作输出”方案，使机器人能通过机载双目摄像头实时生成高精度全身关节控制指令。在测试中，Optimus在应对外力推搡、不平整路面行走及精细抓取任务时，动作流畅度与反应速度显著提升，对标真人水平。硬件方面，特斯拉通过优化轻量化材料与关节电机降低了能耗并提升续航。目前，得克萨斯超级工厂正加速建设专用生产线，推进该机型的大规模量产。此次升级标志着具身智能从实验室走向商业化应用，人形机器人正式进入全栈AI驱动的新时代。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI、谷歌、微软与Anthropic联手制定统一AI爬虫拒绝标准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f58bf6d430c1f9a77228c4b71ce645c6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI、谷歌、微软与Anthropic于11月1日宣布共同采用一套新标准，允许网站主通过统一的robots.txt文件声明拒绝AI抓取。该机制由Anthropic技术负责人Kevin Kelley提交至互联网工程任务组（IETF），旨在将robots.txt的管辖范围从搜索引擎扩展至AI训练领域。此前，网站主需针对不同AI厂商分别登记偏好，新标准实现了一次写入、多家通用的便捷管理。目前，Anthropic已率先采用该标准，OpenAI计划在未来数月内落实，谷歌与微软预计于明年跟进，Meta亦对该通用信号表示支持。此举标志着AI爬虫抓取规则从各家分散管理转向统一化，显著降低了内容发布方管理版权与训练数据的技术门槛，推动了AI训练数据合规化进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta携手傅利叶仅用三月研发出人形机器人原型Max</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4a52fb32071ebcaa7e2befd2e8d1271f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta与中国机器人企业傅利叶合作，仅用三个月成功打造出代号为“Max”的人形机器人原型，并于9月启动第二代产品Max2的研发。Max原型机高约1.5米、重48千克，搭载英伟达Jetson Thor芯片，配备可模拟表情的面部屏幕、扬声器及五指机械手，支持5米外语音识别与3米外手势理解。Meta首席技术官Andrew Bosworth将该机器人定义为消费级AI代理产品Muse的实体化形态，Meta机器人业务产品副总裁Li-Chen Miller曾赴上海驻点推进项目。Max2计划升级躯干与机械手，并增设投影仪及楼梯传感器。此举标志着Meta正加速将软件Agent能力延伸至物理环境，积极布局消费级具身智能赛道。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek发布Super-agent原型并开源，实现AI自主多任务调度与执行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c0736f8707d22281ef34a0342d032ba8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek Harness团队发布技术文章并开源原型dsh-superagent-prototype（MIT协议），旨在将AI从被动响应转变为自主执行任务的Agent系统。该系统采用双层架构：常驻前台的Router负责交互与任务分派，后台为每个任务分配隔离的Worker并行处理，并引入事件驱动、存算分离及Watchdog监督机制。针对多任务瓶颈，该方案突破了传统单Session限制，将并发上限从人的注意力转移至系统吞吐。压测数据显示，在处理300条消息及20项请求时，P95耗时从单Session方案的29.5分钟缩短至15.7分钟。官方强调，该原型已在内部实现缺陷复现、代码审查及自动嗅探潜在Bug等功能。配合V4-Pro模型每百万token约1.32/3.96美元的成本优势，该架构显著提升了Agent的自</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
